# Trivy vulnerability allowlist
#
# To suppress a known/accepted CVE, add its ID here (one per line):
#   CVE-YYYY-NNNNN
#
# Each entry must include a comment explaining why it is accepted and
# a review-by date, e.g.:
#
#   CVE-2023-12345  # accepted: fix not yet available upstream; review 2026-09-01
#
# Scan results (SARIF) are uploaded as pipeline artifacts on every build.
# Review them in the Actions run → Artifacts → trivy-{service}.
